    {
     "p": "The Chapter 2 neuter nouns are <em>auxilium</em>, help; <em>bellum</em>, war; <em>donum</em>, gift; <em>periculum</em>, danger; <em>templum</em>, temple; <em>verbum</em>, word; <em>vinum</em>, wine; and the plural <em>arma</em>, weapons."
